  "description": "It was an arranged marriage I had no choice but to agree to. The conditions he set were simple: Don’t expect love. \n\nLive as a show-window couple and divorce when the time is right. I planned to quietly go along with his demands and part ways cleanly. Until the night I spent with my husband. After that night, everything changed. The arranged marriage, which had begun for mutual benefit, started to intertwine with deeper emotions as time went on.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/64069979), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%A0%95%EB%9E%B5%EA%B2%B0%ED%98%BC%EC%9D%98-%EC%A1%B0%EA%B1%B4/4069)\n\n**Official Translations:**     \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/177067)",
